          "downloadUrl": "https://github.com/Encaron/linkdesk-plugin-file-tree/releases/download/v1.0.32/file-tree.linkdesk-plugin",
          "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T11:47:41.666Z",
          "changelog": "- **分类声明（R4-2.8/2.9）**：`plugin.json` 顶层补 `category: \"documents\"` ＋ `categories: [\"files\"]`——商店分类抽屉归位，随本次发版进入官方目录条目。"
